{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To enable microcode updates at boot time, add these lines to
/boot/loader.conf:

cpu_microcode_load="YES"
cpu_microcode_name="/boot/firmware/amd-ucode.bin"

Nothing is applied until the system is rebooted with those lines in place.

Late loading, via sysutils/cpu-microcode-rc and cpucontrol(8), applies the
same images after the root filesystem is mounted.  It is the fallback, not
the equivalent: by then the kernel has already probed CPU features, and any
feature a microcode update adds or removes is missed.
EOM
}
